{"name":"Ghost Whisperer","hex":"#cbd1d0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ghost","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A disembodied soul; a soul or spirit of a deceased person; a spirit appearing after death.","A spirit; a human soul."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["In the form be ghost: not present or involved; absent, gone."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ghost"},{"term":"whisperer","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Someone who whispers.","Someone who tells secrets; a gossip."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/whisperer"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mediumship","blocks":[{"text":"Mediumship is the practice of purportedly mediating communication between familiar spirits or spirits of the dead and living human beings. Practitioners are known as \"mediums\" or \"spirit mediums\". There are different types of mediumship or spirit channelling, including séance tables, trance, and ouija. The practice is associated with spiritualism and spiritism. A similar New Age practice is known as channeling."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Medium-Eva-Carriere-1912.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mediumship","wikidata":"Q25416928"},{"title":"Ghost Whisperer","blocks":[{"text":"Ghost Whisperer is an American supernatural television series, which ran on CBS from September 23, 2005, to May 21, 2010."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/16/Ghost_Whisperer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghost_Whisperer","wikidata":"Q318649"},{"title":"Ghost Whisperer (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Ghost Whisperer is a casual hidden-object mystery adventure game developed by Legacy Games for Microsoft Windows and Mac OS. The Mac version was released in October 2012, requiring Mac OS X 10.5 or later. The game is based on the CBS supernatural television show Ghost Whisperer starring Jennifer Love Hewitt. The game contains two different cases to solve: \"Forgotten Toys\" and \"A Brush with Death\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/61/Ghost_Whisperer_Game.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghost_Whisperer_(video_game)","wikidata":"Q5557221"},{"title":"Ghost","blocks":[{"text":"In folklore, a ghost is the soul or spirit of a dead person or non-human animal that is believed by some people to be able to appear to the living. In ghostlore, descriptions of ghosts vary widely, from an invisible presence to translucent or barely visible wispy shapes to realistic, lifelike forms, whether they resemble humans or animals. The deliberate attempt to contact the spirit of a deceased person is known as necromancy, or in spiritism as a séance. Other terms associated with it are apparition, haunt, haint, phantom, poltergeist, shade, specter, spirit, spook, wraith, demon, and ghoul."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/02/Hammersmith_Ghost.PNG/330px-Hammersmith_Ghost.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghost","wikidata":"Q45529"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/John_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg/500px-John_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/John_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg/1280px-John_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/John_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg/500px-John_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Séance conducted by John Beattie, Bristol, England, 1872","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJohn_Beattie_Eugene_Rochas_seance.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Colin_Evans_fraud_in_1938.jpg/330px-Colin_Evans_fraud_in_1938.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Colin_Evans_fraud_in_1938.jpg/330px-Colin_Evans_fraud_in_1938.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Colin Evans, who claimed spirits lifted him into the air, was exposed as a fraud.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AColin_Evans_fraud_in_1938.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Seance_Doll.jpg/250px-Seance_Doll.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/Seance_Doll.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Seance_Doll.jpg/250px-Seance_Doll.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A photograph of the medium Linda Gazzera with a doll as fake ectoplasm","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASeance_Doll.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Helen_Duncan_fake_ectoplasm.jpg/500px-Helen_Duncan_fake_ectoplasm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Helen_Duncan_fake_ectoplasm.jpg/500px-Helen_Duncan_fake_ectoplasm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Helen Duncan (age 30) in a séance with dolls (1928)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHelen_Duncan_fake_ectoplasm.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Henry_S